template.content:
Write a short Instagram caption about {{?topic}} in a {{?sentiment}} tone. The caption must be written in the language code: {{?language}}.

Respond with ONLY a valid JSON object and nothing else (no markdown, no code fences), in exactly this structure:
{
  "explanation": "<the Instagram caption text>",
  "rating": <integer 1-5 indicating how well the caption matches the requested tone>
}
